   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PFM Assessment in Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PFM Serbien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bed&#xF6;nmning av den serbiska f&#xF6;rvaltningen finansiella kontrollsystem som f&#xF6;rberedlese f&#xF6;r eventuell kanalisering av svenska bist&#xE5;ndsmedel till olika ministerier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the PFM analysis is twofold: provide Sida with an assessment of Serbia&apos;s PFM systems in order to inform the decision about the possibilities for increased use of Serbia&apos;s PFM system and to inform the decision on financing modalities, and to inform Sida about the areas within the PFM system that are in need of improvements.</narrative>
